#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:7
#: 15d0eb3cbcbd4d1d8f053706b1011885
msgid ""
"This page describes the few parameters that should be set in order to "
"support the steering and throttle method being used. This page is closely "
"related to the :ref:`Motor and Servo Connections <rover-motor-and-servo-"
"connections>` page which describes the physical connections between the "
"autopilot, motors, and servos."
msgstr ""
"本页面介绍为支持所用转向和油门方式而需设置的少量参数。本页面与 :ref:`电机和舵机连接 <rover-motor-and-servo-"
"connections>` 页面密切相关，后者介绍飞控、电机和舵机之间的物理连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:11
