#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:48
#: cefd5a6e160d4ecb985538a3a7d440fa
msgid "Motor Driver Types"
msgstr "电机驱动器类型"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:50
#: 57d216b9f95347ec84b5333b7bf5d2e1
msgid ""
"At least three different Motor Driver (aka ESC) types are supported which "
"allows using ArduPilot with most motor drivers.  The :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE "
"<MOT_PWM_TYPE>` parameter should be used to ensure the output from the "
"autopilot board matches the input required by the motor driver."
msgstr ""
"支持至少三种不同的电机驱动器（即电调）类型，使 ArduPilot 能与大多数电机驱动器配合使用。应使用 :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE "
"<MOT_PWM_TYPE>` 参数确保飞控飞控板的输出与电机驱动器所需的输入匹配。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:52
#: 8f813e34eded4c20b8802cde71964024
msgid ""
"\"Normal\" is the most common and involves sending PWM values normally "
"between 1000 and 2000 (1ms ~ 2ms) to an ESC. \"OneShot and OneShot125\" are "
"variants of this (See :ref:`common-brushless-escs`)."
msgstr ""
"「Normal」是最常见的方式，向电调发送通常在 1000 至 2000 之间（1ms ~ 2ms）的 PWM 值。「OneShot 和 "
"OneShot125」是其变体（参见 :ref:`common-brushless-escs`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:53
#: 08bb0661789144908f996548aaa1a6f4
msgid ""
"\"DShotxxxx\" is for use with DShot ESCs and uses a serial digial control "
"stream (see :ref:`common-dshot-escs`)"
msgstr "「DShotxxxx」用于 DShot 电调，使用串行数字控制流（参见 :ref:`common-dshot-escs`）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:54
#: e343215da9ff4c7a92d75cf5f3ff3752
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"\":ref:`Brushed With Relay <common-brushed-motors>`\" is for brushed motor "
"drivers that use a :ref:`relay pin <common-relay>` to indicate whether it "
"should rotate forward or backward. Output is 0-100% duty cycle waveform."
msgstr ""
"「:ref:`有刷继电器 <common-brushed-motors>`」用于通过 :ref:`继电器引脚 <common-relay>` "
"指示正转或反转的有刷电机驱动器。输出为 0-100% 占空比波形。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:55
#: 557d5e7669cd4e7b9cefb5ea6e5292e0
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"\"Brushed BiPolar\" is for brushed motor drivers that, a bit like \"Normal\""
" PWM. These devices interpret a low PWM value for reverse, a high PWM value "
"for forward. Output is q 0-100% duty cycle waveform."
msgstr ""
"「有刷双极」用于有刷电机驱动器，类似于「Normal」PWM。这些设备将低 PWM 值解释为反转，高 PWM 值解释为正转。输出为 0-100% "
"占空比波形。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:57
#: 40f873ebfc904c099be5ff4706b0fb87
msgid ""
"Brushed motors are updated at the :ref:`MOT_PWM_FREQ<MOT_PWM_FREQ>` rate. "
"Make sure that it is set at a value compatible with the brushed motor/esc "
"you are using."
msgstr "有刷电机按 :ref:`MOT_PWM_FREQ<MOT_PWM_FREQ>` 频率更新。请确保将其设置为与所用有刷电机/电调兼容的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:60
#: c4bba4fa91794ae4b4a969b7c9a0a87e
msgid "Reversing"
msgstr "反转"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:62
#: d49a2565ce7e4e5f9c6167a0f43d732c
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Rover vehicles may/or may not use reversing motors depending on "
"configuration. If an ESC is used, usually 1500us is used to indicate idle "
"for PWM and DShot systems. Brushed drivers this point will be 50% duty "
"cycle, if reversible, unless the BRUSHED_WITH_RELAY type is used."
msgstr ""
"Rover 车辆是否使用电机反转取决于配置。如果使用电调，通常对 PWM 和 DShot 系统使用 1500us 表示空闲。有刷驱动器（如可反转）此点为"
" 50% 占空比，除非使用 BRUSHED_WITH_RELAY 类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:65
#: 8f59e42a196f4c32b19d1a79742f1149
msgid "ESC Configuration"
msgstr "电调配置"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:67
#: 75bc80354b4d4c7087d16b6be07ff33d
msgid "Some ESCs support three \"Running Models\":"
msgstr "部分电调支持三种「运行模式」："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:69
#: e136ebf5c01245efac6f4998a6a2b79e
msgid "Forward with brake"
msgstr "正转带刹车"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:70
#: 2f647f5763ed42b8b42d58083e929ea3
msgid "Forward and reverse with brake"
msgstr "正反转带刹车"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:71
#: 30e09bbff4ab40069b1d46970253cb2f
msgid "Forward and Reverse"
msgstr "正反转"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:73
#: c4c282736b1041a28e668ee0c8f8be6a
msgid ""
"For Rover to have full and straightforward control of the throttle it is "
"best to set the \"Running Model\" to the 3rd option, \"Forward and "
"Reverse\".  An ESC programming card compatible with the ESC can normally be "
"used to change the ESC's configuration."
msgstr "为使 Rover 对油门拥有完整且直接的控制权，最好将「运行模式」设置为第 3 选项「正反转」。通常可使用与电调兼容的编程卡更改电调配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:78
#: 34b8b16f81714d98815ab16e3bd65877
msgid "Testing Motor direction"
msgstr "测试电机方向"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:83
#: ad76671cd7544eab9a42dac75b571dcf
msgid ""
"The Mission Planner (and perhaps other GCSs) can be used to test the "
"direction of the motors:"
msgstr "可使用 Mission Planner（以及其他 GCS）测试电机方向："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:85
#: 94c88090c9734b64812ffe680e6f1fb0
msgid ""
"plug in the vehicle's battery and place the vehicle on a stand so that its "
"wheels can move freely"
msgstr "插入车辆电池，将车辆放在支架上使车轮可以自由转动"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:86
#: fa9e2f989bbc46109e942396035418bf
msgid "connect with the Mission Planner using USB or telemetry radio"
msgstr "通过 USB 或数传无线电连接 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:87
#: 5de3027e75fd4bf68b97dd15aa34b538
msgid "go to the Initial Setup >> Optional Hardware >> Motor Test page"
msgstr "前往「初始设置 >> 可选硬件 >> 电机测试」页面"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:88
#: 5a3aa2b897384b30bf049c25d104106c
msgid "increase the \"Throttle %\" to 20"
msgstr "将「油门 %」增加至 20"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:89
#: 695692a64cea4897bb4ed7b0f5850584
msgid "push the \"Test motor\" buttons to test the steering and motors."
msgstr "按「测试电机」按钮测试转向和电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:91
#: cc8ed24a42be40938dd19ddce7f4e306
msgid ""
"for rovers with separate steering and throttle, pushing the \"Test motor A\""
" button should cause the wheels to turn forward, \"Test motor B\" should "
"cause steering to turn right."
msgstr "对于独立转向和油门的漫游车，按「测试电机 A」按钮应使车轮向前转动，「测试电机 B」应使转向向右偏转。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:92
#: 131b5a57da8a446795bc7b682d4d3fbe
msgid ""
"for rovers with skid steering, \"Test motor C\" should cause the left wheel "
"to turn forward.  \"Test motor D\" should cause the right wheel to turn "
"forward."
msgstr "对于差速转向漫游车，「测试电机 C」应使左轮向前转动，「测试电机 D」应使右轮向前转动。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:93
#: d9beefa69ab24a5d80aee7fcfaa346fc
msgid ""
"If the motors or steering do not move in the correct direction change the "
"appropriate ``SERVOx_REVERSED`` value and try again."
msgstr "如果电机或转向未朝正确方向运动，请更改相应的 ``SERVOx_REVERSED`` 值后重试。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:94
#: 96b16b16cb5945fd8eeafa93c0f559ce
msgid ""
"if a \"command rejected\" message appears or the motors or steering do not "
"respond to the test, the cause may be written in the Mission Planner's "
"Flight Data >> Messages tab (see bottom left of the window).  Common causes "
"include the radio calibration having not been performed or the "
"``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` parameters having not been set correctly."
msgstr ""
"如果出现「命令被拒绝」消息，或电机/转向对测试无响应，原因可能记录在 Mission Planner 的「飞行数据 >> "
"消息」标签页中（见窗口左下角）。常见原因包括未执行遥控校准或 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 参数设置不正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:99
#: 4c819eb0cb1d4ec1b1b8f0b40af0b1eb
msgid "Minimum Throttle"
msgstr "最小油门"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:100
#: 1dbc8663753a4a3983b87d27f3e50cc9
msgid ""
"Many motors and ESCs have a dead zone. This is the zone between the zero "
"throttle value and the throttle value at which the motor starts to move. "
"This can be compensated by setting minimum throttle in the firmware."
msgstr "许多电机和电调存在死区，即从零油门值到电机开始转动的油门值之间的区间。可通过在固件中设置最小油门来补偿此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:102
#: cd877401f1ae4f28b049cded5c0e6230
msgid ""
"Remove wheels before proceeding with surface vehicles. Be aware of "
"propellers on boats if they cannot be easily removed!"
msgstr "对于地面车辆，在操作前请拆下车轮。对于船只，如果螺旋桨无法轻易拆卸，请注意安全！"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:104
#: 4d938ca76f9040e79f3d796cc921aeb1
msgid ""
"To fix the dead zone, open the motor test window in Mission Planner, as "
"mentioned :ref:`below<rover-motor-and-servo-configuration-testing>`.  Find "
"the minimum throttle value at which the motor turns on and set the parameter"
" :ref:`MOT_THR_MIN<MOT_THR_MIN>` to that value. Now the motor should start "
"at 1% throttle."
msgstr ""
"要修复死区，请在 Mission Planner 中打开电机测试窗口（如下文 :ref:`所述<rover-motor-and-servo-"
"configuration-testing>`）。找到电机启动的最小油门值，并将 :ref:`MOT_THR_MIN<MOT_THR_MIN>` "
"参数设置为该值。此后电机应在 1% 油门时启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:110
#: 649b7f579a6947a7904c62c6cb9dba6f
msgid "Steering Speed scaling"
msgstr "转向速度缩放"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:112
#: 452dd34c52444480a23661191c3cd1f0
msgid ""
"The amount of steering that a vehicle can apply without tipping due to "
"lateral acceleration can be adjusted by changing "
":ref:`MOT_SPD_SCA_BASE<MOT_SPD_SCA_BASE>`. Speeds below this value will have"
" the full steering angle. Speeds above will have the maximum steering angle "
"reduced by the fraction :ref:`MOT_SPD_SCA_BASE<MOT_SPD_SCA_BASE>` / "
"GroundSpeed."
msgstr ""
"车辆在不因横向加速度倾翻的前提下所能施加的最大转向量，可通过修改 :ref:`MOT_SPD_SCA_BASE<MOT_SPD_SCA_BASE>` "
"来调整。低于此速度时，转向角不受限制；超过此速度后，最大转向角将按 :ref:`MOT_SPD_SCA_BASE<MOT_SPD_SCA_BASE>` "
"/ 地速 的比例缩小。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-configuration.rst:114
#: e8651ceee0c44c34850301e4515a8fcc
msgid ""
"This scaling is used at all times in Acro, Hold, Steering, Auto, RTL, Smart "
"RTL, and Follow. In Guided mode, it is used except when direct steering and "
"throttle are provided as input commands. In Manual mode, the use of this "
"scaling is enabled by the first bit of "
":ref:`MANUAL_OPTIONS<MANUAL_OPTIONS>`."
msgstr ""
"此缩放在 Acro、Hold、Steering、Auto、RTL、Smart RTL 和 Follow 模式下始终生效。在 Guided "
"模式下，除非以直接转向和油门作为输入指令，否则同样生效。在 Manual 模式下，是否启用此缩放由 "
":ref:`MANUAL_OPTIONS<MANUAL_OPTIONS>` 的第一位控制。"
